---
title: Brownies!!!
image: https://cheneetoday.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/best-walnut-brownie-recipe.jpg
---

Preheat the oven to 300°F.

Beat @eggs{4} until fluffy.

Add @sugar{1%cup} and @brown sugar{1%cup}.

Stir in @butter{1%stick}(melted), @cocoa{1.25%cups}, @vanilla{2%tsp}, @all-purpose flour{1/2%cup}, @kosher salt{1/2%tsp}, @walnuts{1/2%cup}(chopped), and @chocolate chips{1/2%cup}, and mix to combine.

Pour the batter into a parchment paper lined #8-inch square pan{}.

Bake for ~{45%minutes}.

> Check for doneness by inserting a toothpick into the center of the pan. It should come out clean.

Remove to a rack and cool before enjoying.